OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly and foggy start to the
OL,6,Fday for many, with fog dense for some.
OL,7,FThe fog will gradually lift and thin
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, leaving a
OL,9,Fgenerally dry day with some decent
OL,10,Fsunny spells developing during the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry overnight with plenty of
OL,14,Fclear spells across the region. Fog is
OL,15,Flikely to reform once again, most
OL,16,Fextensive in northern spots. Chilly,
OL,17,Fwith frost possible in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
