OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA foggy start for many, which
OL,6,Fis gradually clear. Cloud and rain
OL,7,Fspreading into southern parts through
OL,8,Fthe morning, spreading to most parts
OL,9,Flater. Winds increasing through the
OL,10,Fday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloud
OL,13,Fand patchy rain on Wednesday but
OL,14,Fturning drier and somewhat brighter
OL,15,Ffor all through the afternoon. Drier
OL,16,Ffor many on Thursday with some rain to
OL,17,Fthe southwest. Brighter Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
